    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "2. *M*<sub>r</sub> of CuSO<sub>4</sub>•5H<sub>2</sub>O: = 63.5 + 32.1 + (4 x 16.0) + 5 x ((2 x 1.0) + 16.0)               *                                    *= **249.6 **              *M*<sub>r</sub> of Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>•H<sub>2</sub>O = 63.5 + (4 x (14.0 + 3 x 1.0) + 32.1 + (4 x 16.0) + (2 x 1.0) + 16.0                                                           = **245.6**",
